# Cloudflare Pages routing.
#
# /admin, /wedding and /upload are real directories with an index.html, so they
# serve natively — no rule needed, and no fight with Pages' automatic
# .html -> clean-URL redirect (which previously turned /admin into a loop).
#
# Only the slug routes need rewriting. 200 = serve that file but KEEP the
# address bar, which is what lets resolveSlug() read the slug from the path.

/w/*  /wedding/  200
/u/*  /upload/   200
